  ["table.stdev"] = {
    children = {},
    description = [[
Computes the standard deviation of numeric values in `array`. When `sample` is `true`, divides by n-1 (sample standard deviation). Otherwise divides by n (population standard deviation). Strings naming a number count as numeric values and are coerced. Other non-numeric values are skipped. Returns NaN if no numeric values exist.

The mean, and then the sum of squared deviations from it, are each computed in floating point in a fixed order. The term for index `i` is added into accumulator `(i - 1) % 8`, starting from eight zeros, and the accumulators are then combined pairwise: accumulator `j` with `j + 4` for `j` from 0 to 3, then the first of those four sums with the third and the second with the fourth, and finally those two. The result is therefore the same on every platform and for every way the table is stored.]],
    fastcall = true,
    kind = "function",
    module = "table",
    name = "table.stdev",
    origin = "lus",
    params = {
      {
        name = "array",
        type = "table",
      },
      {
        name = "sample",
        optional = true,
        type = "boolean",
      },
    },
    parent = "table",
    returns = {
      {
        type = "number",
      },
    },
    short_name = "stdev",
    since = "1.6.0",
    source = "stdlib/table/stdev.md",
    stability = "stable",
  },
  ["table.sum"] = {
    children = {},
    description = [[
Computes the sum of numeric values in `array`. Strings naming a number count as numeric values and are coerced. Other non-numeric values are skipped. Returns `0` for an empty table.

The sum is computed in floating point in a fixed order. The value at index `i` is added into accumulator `(i - 1) % 8`, starting from eight zeros, and the accumulators are then combined pairwise: accumulator `j` with `j + 4` for `j` from 0 to 3, then the first of those four sums with the third and the second with the fourth, and finally those two. The result is therefore the same on every platform and for every way the table is stored.]],
    fastcall = true,
    kind = "function",
    module = "table",
    name = "table.sum",
    origin = "lus",
    params = {
      {
        name = "array",
