An `instant` supports: `i:epoch()`, `i:nanos()`, `i:format(fmt)`, `i:iso()`, `i:at(zone)` (render as a `zoned` in a `zone` or a fixed offset in seconds), the operators `i + duration`, `i - duration`, `i - instant` (a `duration`), and the comparisons `==`, `<`, `<=`.]],
